# Every change to a Gomega-built site is reviewed before it merges.
#
# GitHub requests this reviewer automatically on every pull request, so nobody
# has to remember who to ask and a PR cannot quietly sit with no reviewer
# assigned. That failure is invisible: the PR looks healthy, CI is green, and
# nothing says it is unassigned.
#
# `tommy-gomega` reviews the zleague repositories and is NOT a collaborator
# here. Requesting them in this org fails with a 422 and leaves the PR
# unreviewed, so do not add them as a fallback.
#
# This file is part of the site-starter template, so every site scaffolded from
# it inherits the rule. Sites created before it landed need it copied in.

* @website-pr-review-mega
